Short:        A Dice Linklib to play samples
Author:       zxmzy01@student.uni-tuebingen.de
Uploader:     dito
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This is a small archive that contains some Dice Linklibraries that allow
you to include samples in your programs without much effort. The stuff
may be easily adapted for usage with SAS/C or other languages. The sources
are included and it's Freeware :c)

This is a MAJOR UPGRADE because it contains 2 brandnew functions to play
samples directly of the harddisk.
